This repository started as a fork of rootstudioyaml/sprag. This branch
contains none of sprag's code: only a Claude Code subagent definition, its
install scripts and documentation written for this repository. The earlier
modified sprag code is kept on the branches review-fixes-2026-11 and
upstream-3.109.0.

This project was inspired by sprag (https://github.com/rootstudioyaml/sprag):
the idea of handing long reads to a cheaper subagent comes from sprag, rebuilt
here as a single agent file.
